# T|X landscape (480x320 guest, 320 play area). Frond's replay pen points are in
# the device's own portrait surface (320 wide, 480 tall) whatever the guest turns
# to: (x, y) there is (y, 320 - x) in landscape. The OS turns the 5-way with the
# screen, so the physical up and down are the game's left and right. The guest
# can run behind real time, so touches are held for seconds.
3500 snapshot "before.png"
4000 key-down down
5200 key-up down
6200 snapshot "after-nav-down.png"
6600 key-down up
7800 key-up up
8800 snapshot "after-nav-up.png"
9000 pen-down 100 100
12000 snapshot "pen-a.png"
12500 pen-up
13500 pen-down 220 250
16500 snapshot "pen-b.png"
17000 pen-up
